    "post_rendered": "<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\"  width=\"42\" height=\"13\" > is an acute triangle with orthocenter <span style=\"white-space:pre;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b1902d279ba37d60bdce4e0e987b7cd19d48974e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H$\"  width=\"16\" height=\"12\" >.</span> Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\"  width=\"14\" height=\"12\" > is in triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/e/14ef80efa9fd67f322d3769f5d69395d9a762fef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BHC$\"  width=\"45\" height=\"12\" > that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/4/824a837270c6ff4466e18c76bc5667e3320271f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle HPC = 3 \\angle HBC $\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"152\" height=\"14\" > and <span style=\"white-space:pre;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/4/da4d2d1dcd32f1dda8bb3d4e99369844ed35d173.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle HPB =3 \\angle HCB $\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"152\" height=\"14\" >.</span> Reflection of point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\"  width=\"14\" height=\"12\" > through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/6/626730e9524e625317ffa9579dacd73e163cfb5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BH,CH$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"69\" height=\"16\" > is <span style=\"white-space:pre;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/c/81cee936d2982eea5fb6e68b6167da70a1c690fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X,Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"37\" height=\"16\" >.</span> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\"  width=\"12\" height=\"12\" > is the center of circumcircle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/0/bd04177a618735863023311466628751c3844633.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AXY$\"  width=\"44\" height=\"13\" > , Prove that:<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6ff1e5c968ea126947c560402be0718b105de9ad.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"$$\\angle BAS = \\angle CAP$$\"  width=\"132\" height=\"13\" ><br>\n<i>Proposed by Pouria Mahmoudkhan Shirazi </i>",
    "post_canonical": "$ABC$ is an acute triangle with orthocenter $H$. Point $P$ is in triangle $BHC$ that $\\angle HPC = 3 \\angle HBC $ and $\\angle HPB =3 \\angle HCB $. Reflection of point $P$ through $BH,CH$ is $X,Y$. if $S$ is the center of circumcircle of $AXY$ , Prove that:\n $$\\angle BAS = \\angle CAP$$\n\n[i]Proposed by Pouria Mahmoudkhan Shirazi [/i]",
