    "poster_id": 195510,
    "post_rendered": "Find all injective <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/e/9be9515a4bae84dc9cfff2aaf6438f30110dd815.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:\\mathbb{Z}\\ge0 \\to \\mathbb{Z}\\ge0 $\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" > that for every natural number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\"  width=\"10\" height=\"8\" > and real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfd1eac99a236a1401929cb2061d3865d1199b5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0,a_1,...,a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"13\" > (not everyone equal to <span style=\"white-space:pre;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\"  width=\"8\" height=\"12\" >)</span>, polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/600b0249b7f1ef1e859d45389f462c81160648ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i=0}^{n}{a_i x^i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"62\" height=\"53\" > have real root if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/b/c8b4f4571ef18185414abefd90f4af69455d56dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i=0}^{n}{a_i x^{f(i)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"80\" height=\"53\" > have real root.<br>\n<br>\n<i>Proposed by Hesam Rajabzadeh </i>",
    "post_canonical": "Find all injective $f:\\mathbb{Z}\\ge0 \\to \\mathbb{Z}\\ge0 $ that for every natural number $n$ and real numbers $a_0,a_1,...,a_n$ (not everyone equal to $0$), polynomial $\\sum_{i=0}^{n}{a_i x^i}$ have real root if and only if $\\sum_{i=0}^{n}{a_i x^{f(i)}}$ have real root.\n\n[i]Proposed by Hesam Rajabzadeh [/i]",
